---
import Base from "~/layouts/Base.astro";
---

<Base title="Now · Luke Sarfas" description="What I'm focused on right now.">
  <section class="hero" style="padding-top:3rem;padding-bottom:0">
    <span class="eyebrow">Now</span>
    <h1>What I'm doing <span class="gradient-text">right now</span></h1>
    <p class="lead">
      A snapshot of what has my attention this season. Inspired by
      <a href="https://nownownow.com/about" rel="noreferrer">nownownow</a>.
    </p>
  </section>

  <section class="section" style="margin-top:2.5rem">
    <div class="prose">
      <p>
        Currently a software engineer at Google in London, working on the things
        software engineers work on. Outside of that, building a couple of side
        projects in this monorepo, the most recent of which is
        <a href="/projects/">listed here</a>.
      </p>
      <p>
        This page exists so I have somewhere to keep the answer to "what are you
        up to?" without having to repeat myself. If it's been more than a couple
        of months since the date below and it still looks like this, the page is
        stale. Email me and call me out.
      </p>
      <p class="updated muted">More to come.</p>
    </div>
  </section>
</Base>

<style>
  .prose p {
    margin-bottom: 1rem;
    max-width: 70ch;
  }
  .updated {
    margin-top: 2.5rem;
    font-size: 0.85rem;
  }
</style>
